ANNOTATION: "SEP-XBAR-EXT-ID-ADDR: the ext initiator is the sep_system_peripherals forward path only (sep.sv:432). Its ID passes axi_id_remap with 4 table entries, which drives mst aw/ar id as {1'b0, 2-bit index} (vendor/pulp-platform/axi/upstream/src/axi_id_remap.sv:198-200; MAX_INFLIGHT_IDS=4 at hw/sys/sep/rtl/sep_system_peripherals/rtl/sep_system_peripherals.sv:642), so id[2] is constant 0. Its address comes from peripheral-xbar port 0, whose rules end at 0x4000_0000 (hw/sys/sep/rtl/crossbars/sep_system_peripherals_xbar.sv:63-67, sep_system_peripherals_xbar_pkg.sv:186-194), truncated to 32 bits, so addr[31:30] are constant 0. NOT waived: id[1:0], addr[29:0] and every other field, which the SMN inbound port drives."
